Q('강의록1 26–27쪽','음성 근간대경련(asterixis)과 같은 말은?',['Flapping tremor','Intention tremor','Pill-rolling tremor','Physiologic tremor','Hemiballism'],1,'강의록1 27쪽: Negative myoclonus(= Asterixis, = Flapping tremor).',['정답.','소뇌.','파킨슨.','생리적.','도리깨질.']),
